// Two-line exchanges for start-up founders. The first line is the player's, the second the character's; each knot is one exchange.

=== greeting ===
Hi, what do you work on? # who:player
Glad you asked. We are making the future a little less awkward.
-> END

=== smalltalk ===
How is the funding round going? # who:player
Lots of enthusiasm, zero wire transfers. So, great.
-> END

=== busy ===
Do you have a minute? # who:player
I have thirty seconds and a pitch. Pick one.
-> END

=== deflect ===
Is the product actually ready? # who:player
Define ready. We prefer the term early.
-> END

=== farewell ===
Good luck with the launch. # who:player
Luck is a growth channel. Thanks.
-> END
